<td class="description">Convert input signals to uint8 vector</td></tr><tr><td class="term"><a href="../ecoder/ref/bytereversal.html">Byte Reversal</a></td>
<td class="description">Reverse order of bytes in input word</td></tr><tr><td class="term"><a href="../ecoder/ref/byteunpack.html">Byte Unpack</a></td>
<td class="description">Unpack UDP uint8 input vector into Simulink data
