<td class="description">Send message to remote IP interface</td></tr><tr><td class="term"><a href="../ecoder/ref/c6000udpreceive.html">C6000 UDP Receive</a></td>
<td class="description">Receive uint8 vector as UDP message</td></tr><tr><td class="term"><a href="../ecoder/ref/c6000udpsend.html">C6000 UDP Send</a></td>
<td class="description">Send UDP message to host</td></tr><tr><td class="term"><a href="../ecoder/ref/canpack.html">CAN Pack</a></td>
